<title>HONG KONG: S.C Strategic 1996 net loss HK$56.56 mln.</title>
<headline>S.C Strategic 1996 net loss HK$56.56 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   5.9 loss   vs 1.8 loss</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	  vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil	  vs 4.37 loss</p>
<p>    Net			    56.56 loss vs 12.46 loss</p>
<p>    Turnover		     54.13	vs 10.63</p>
<p>    Company name		 South China Strategic Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  June 4-6</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - South China Strategic manufactures pharmaceuticals products.</p>
<p>The company changed its financial year end to December 31 from March 31. Comparative figures were for nine-months to December 31, 1995.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is nil vs nil.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
